 "splits": {
  "10": [
   {
    "text": "You can't call me.",
    "speaker": "Diane Eggers"
   },
   {
    "text": "But, Diane....",
    "speaker": "Rick Eggers"
   }
  ],
  "18": [
   {
    "text": "Stop calling.",
    "speaker": "Diane Eggers"
   },
   {
    "text": "Don't hang up, Diane. Di--",
    "speaker": "Rick Eggers"
   }
  ],
  "79": [
   {
    "text": "What's the FBI doing here?",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "The FBI has jurisdiction...",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "86": [
   {
    "text": "...and would likely kill again.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Evidence doesn't support that.",
    "speaker": "Officer Wentworth"
   }
  ],
  "90": [
   {
    "text": "...we've dismissed.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "These aren't just careless assumptions.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "99": [
   {
    "text": "Really, Mulder?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Sometimes mixed with wild dogs.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "103": [
   {
    "text": "Does that sound like a wolf to you?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I wasn't thinking wolf.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "106": [
   {
    "text": "It's a large black dog that guards the gates of the underworld.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "That's neither here nor there.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "112": [
   {
    "text": "...people don't just spontaneously combust.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "That woman was undoubtedly an innocent...",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "125": [
   {
    "text": "Never gets easier.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "It's an innocent life cut short.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "138": [
   {
    "text": "You know the profile.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Eyewitnesses exculpate the mother.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "147": [
   {
    "text": "What would be the significance of that?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm not sure.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "151": [
   {
    "text": "And her mother was right there with her.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Seems very odd to me.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "166": [
   {
    "text": "...and free from our sins.",
    "speaker": "Pastor"
   },
   {
    "text": "Amen.",
    "speaker": "Congregation"
   }
  ],
  "197": [
   {
    "text": "She's just a little girl.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "We need to cooperate with them.",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   }
  ],
  "199": [
   {
    "text": "Anna, just play nice.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "I was there. We didn't see anything.",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   }
  ],
  "213": [
   {
    "text": "Bibbletiggles.",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "...Bibbletiggles.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "215": [
   {
    "text": "Well, who wouldn't be?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I just-- I can't--",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   }
  ],
  "223": [
   {
    "text": "Are you from around here?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Yeah, right down the street.",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   }
  ],
  "236": [
   {
    "text": "Anything else, Agent Mulder?",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "No.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "237": [
   {
    "text": "Thank you for your time.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Mr. Chuckleteeth",
    "speaker": "Children on TV"
   }
  ],
  "238": [
   {
    "text": "Mommy!",
    "speaker": "Emily"
   },
   {
    "text": "Happy as can be",
    "speaker": "Children on TV"
   }
  ],
  "239": [
   {
    "text": "Mr. Chuckleteeth, won't you play with me?",
    "speaker": "Children on TV"
   },
   {
    "text": "He was in the forest.",
    "speaker": "Emily"
   }
  ],
  "247": [
   {
    "text": "Don't go there.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "When the child is under the age of 5...",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "249": [
   {
    "text": "Rick Eggers did not kill his son.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "Most of the time, friends and family...",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "252": [
   {
    "text": "I've heard about enough.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "I want to rule him out as a suspect.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "254": [
   {
    "text": "A good cop.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "But I need your help.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "256": [
   {
    "text": "...to become violent towards themselves.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'd confront him myself, but I don't have to.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   }
  ],
  "258": [
   {
    "text": "With you or out on his own?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Why don't you ask him yourself?",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   }
  ],
  "303": [
   {
    "text": "Whose house are we searching?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Convicted sex offender, Melvin Peter.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "306": [
   {
    "text": "Who figured that out?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Father of the deceased. Right over there.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "309": [
   {
    "text": "You sure about that, Mulder?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm not sure about anything.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "327": [
   {
    "text": "Why are you defending him?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "I'm not defending him.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "333": [
   {
    "text": "...than to imprison one innocent man.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "I am all for benefit of the doubt...",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   }
  ],
  "357": [
   {
    "text": "No, no, no. No, Anna. No. Don't go there.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "Em.",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   }
  ],
  "358": [
   {
    "text": "Don't.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "No, no, no. Emily!",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   }
  ],
  "359": [
   {
    "text": "Let me go! Emily!",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "No. Stop, stop. Stop.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   }
  ],
  "376": [
   {
    "text": "Mulder, stop--",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "When casting spells or curses.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "382": [
   {
    "text": "But sometimes could take human shape...",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "What are you doing?",
    "speaker": "Officer Sean"
   }
  ],
  "386": [
   {
    "text": "What do you mean, a TV character?",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Mind telling me what you're doing?",
    "speaker": "Officer Sean"
   }
  ],
  "394": [
   {
    "text": "What did I do wrong?",
    "speaker": "Melvin Peter"
   },
   {
    "text": "You killed my boy!",
    "speaker": "Rick Eggers"
   }
  ],
  "399": [
   {
    "text": "Mulder.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "No, it's....",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   }
  ],
  "400": [
   {
    "text": "It's okay. He's right.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "You ought to take a beat, chief...",
    "speaker": "Officer Sean"
   }
  ],
  "406": [
   {
    "text": "Especially not Emily.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "Then what's your part in all of this?",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "420": [
   {
    "text": "Oh, God.",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "Let's all give him some room.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "432": [
   {
    "text": "Officer involved.",
    "speaker": "Officer on Radio"
   },
   {
    "text": "Copy.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "437": [
   {
    "text": "Hold it. Eggers, stop! Stop!",
    "speaker": "Officer Wentworth"
   },
   {
    "text": "Hey! Back off! Don't do this!",
    "speaker": "Officer Wentworth"
   }
  ],
  "441": [
   {
    "text": "Let me go!",
    "speaker": "Rick Eggers"
   },
   {
    "text": "Hey! Relax, all right?",
    "speaker": "Officer Wentworth"
   }
  ],
  "445": [
   {
    "text": "Oh, no! Don't you talk to me about kids!",
    "speaker": "Rick Eggers"
   },
   {
    "text": "All right. Relax. Everyone, back up!",
    "speaker": "Officer Sean"
   }
  ],
  "449": [
   {
    "text": "Get off him. Hey!",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   },
   {
    "text": "Please!",
    "speaker": "Melvin Peter"
   }
  ],
  "481": [
   {
    "text": "You still haven't answered my question.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Mr. Eggers.",
    "speaker": "Judge"
   }
  ],
  "571": [
   {
    "text": "There's a patrol car on the corner.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "There's no one inside.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "576": [
   {
    "text": "...and it was probably a crime of passion.",
    "speaker": "Dana Scully"
   },
   {
    "text": "Yeah, and the gates of hell.",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ],
  "594": [
   {
    "text": "Don't!",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "I have to end what I started.",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   }
  ],
  "600": [
   {
    "text": "Our baby girl?",
    "speaker": "Chief Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "I was only trying to curse you.",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   }
  ],
  "612": [
   {
    "text": "No. No, I can end this. Please.",
    "speaker": "Anna Strong"
   },
   {
    "text": "No, no. You may have tapped into something...",
    "speaker": "Fox Mulder"
   }
  ]
 },
 "text": {
  "129": "...is completely torn out and missing.",
  "251": "Because they carry out their fantasies in private.",
  "294": "I'm not quite sure yet. But the dead boy's father has had a breakdown.",
  "321": "He's potentially John Wayne Gacy with a monkey.",
  "332": "...that it's better to let 10 guilty men go free...",
  "355": "Is this the killing field?",
  "378": "Mulder, this is protecting no one, and you can't do this.",
  "383": "...in the guise of their victims' ardent desires or a woman luring a man to his death or....",
  "408": "I am a...",
  "409": "...lustful man.",
  "418": "See, I'm being punished.",
  "428": "So you think Chief Strong unleashed something?",
  "473": "...is in this courtroom today.",
  "501": "I told Chief Strong, but he didn't wanna hear it.",
  "509": "See him get what's coming to him.",
  "573": "It has instructions for summoning spirits and demons.",
  "601": "You've unleashed something you can't control!"
 },
